ine-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606120401088201_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606120401088201_1280.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-13/match1867415date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世界杯首分！加拿大1-1波黑 卢基奇破门拉林替补登场121秒扳平</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260613/zhanbao_image_1867415_1781297775_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260613/zhanbao_image_1867415_1781297775_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260613/zhanbao_image_1867415_1781297775_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">加拿大1-1战平波黑，加拿大也收获了队史首个世界杯积分，终结了此前6战全败的纪录。</span></p><p><strong>【世界杯数据】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-13/6a2c6140a08c1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">0的突破！加拿大结束世界杯6连败，收获队史世界杯首分</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260613/6a2c7069cf588.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260613/6a2c7069cf588.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260613/6a2c7069cf588.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯小组赛B组第1轮，加拿大1-1战平波黑，收获球队在世界杯的首个积分。加拿大此前参加过1986和2022世界杯，6场小组赛全败，打进2球丢了12球。</p><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-13/6a2c3bf16e613native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">涉嫌强奸！官方：托马斯被拒绝入境加拿大，无缘出战世界杯首战</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260613/6a2c4ecf802b6.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260613/6a2c4ecf802b6.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260613/6a2c4ecf802b6.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">国际足联向《The Athletic》发表声明称，托马斯·帕尔特伊被加拿大拒绝入境，无缘加纳世界杯首战。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-13/6a2c4f2d4889dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">加拿大开幕式翻车！大力神杯气球充气装置故障，气球升起后变瘪</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.52" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260613/202606130226227650.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.52" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.52" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260613/202606130226227650.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260613/202606130226227650.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯第二日，加拿大对阵波黑赛前的开幕表演发生意外。表演中，充气的大力神杯缓缓升起，但充气装置发生故障，气球逐渐变瘪。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-12/6a2c2234220b3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">乐不思蜀！韩国球迷在墨西哥已玩嗨，与当地陌生女球迷接吻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606122332278478.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606122332278478.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606122332278478.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯首日，A组墨西哥和韩国先后取胜，两国球迷沉浸在胜利的喜悦中。当地的镜头拍摄到，许多前往墨西哥看球的韩国球迷与当地球迷一同在街头狂欢庆祝。其中不少人已经玩嗨了，甚至有当地女孩主动与韩国球迷接吻。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-13/6a2c3dd1d3d5dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴媒：安帅近日训练坚持同一套424首发，桑德罗、达尼洛边后卫</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.47" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260613/202606130113423958.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.47" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.47" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260613/202606130113423958.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260613/202606130113423958.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">巴西ESPN消息，安切洛蒂几乎明牌了对阵摩洛哥的首发阵容。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-13/6a2c4dd3c570enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">主裁判伤退！官方：奥利弗受伤，莱特西耶吹罚科特迪瓦vs厄瓜多尔</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260613/202606130222117437.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260613/202606130222117437.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260613/202606130222117437.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">FIFA官方消息，英格兰裁判迈克尔·奥利弗受伤，无法执法科特迪瓦vs厄瓜多尔的比赛，主裁判更换为法国裁判莱特西耶。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-13/6a2c5f5c34611native.htm" t